### Test Wallet API Endpoints
### Make sure your backend server is running on http://localhost:5000

### 1. Login as a USER to get auth token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@mitcoe.edu",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Get Wallet Balance (replace YOUR_TOKEN with token from login response)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/wallet/balance
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### 3. Check if wallet routes are registered
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1
